ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 October to November ran 41% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far March to April sat at 37%. Grid 20310 had its driest year in 1965 at 63%.</p>"}
